# Cursor Rules — Polaris (Digitaro HRMS)

> New agent? Read `ai-config/START-HERE-AI-AGENTS.md` (5 min), then `AGENTS.md`.

## What this is

**Polaris** — Digitaro's internal HR platform (~100–200 workers, PK/UAE/SG). Repo: `hrms`. Not a generic starter kit.

- **Frontend:** Next.js 16, PrimeReact, Tailwind 4, Lucide icons, Better Auth + Entra OIDC
- **Backend:** NestJS 10 modular monolith, TypeORM, PostgreSQL, Redis, BullMQ
- **Specs:** `docs/` is canonical — implement from there, not `local-docs/`

## Before any feature

1. `docs/generated/tasks.md` — current phase (Phase 0 now)
2. `docs/project-requirements/prd.md` §6.x — functional detail
3. `docs/compliance/feature-flows.md` — FLW-* controls (mandatory)
4. Folder `AGENTS.md` — backend / frontend / docs patterns
5. Build plan: `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-03-polaris-build-plan.md`

**Never implement undocumented features.** Never hard-code country logic (`if country === 'PK'`).

## Critical rules

| Rule | Detail |
|---|---|
| Auth | Better Auth + **Entra OIDC** (employees) + email (contractors). NOT NextAuth |
| API | `/api/v1/`, envelope `{ data, meta, errors }`, every mutation → `audit_log` |
| RBAC | Row scope (own/team/division/all) + field redaction server-side |
| Country | Config tables only — `employment_type_country_configs` |
| UX | Status tracker on workflows; Hub as inbox; one-tap check-in; 5 UI states |
| Icons | Lucide React only — no emoji, Heroicons, react-icons |
| Phase | No Phase 2 (payroll) during Phase 0/1 unless asked |
| Language | **English only** — all UI strings in `locales/en.json`; do not edit `ar.json`/`fr.json`; no RTL |

## Explicit exclusions

Xero API, Capacitor/native wrapper, non-English UI locales, QES e-sign, statutory remittance portals, WhatsApp Business API.

## Workflow

Requirements → compliance flow → backend (entity, migration, service, controller, test) → frontend (ui-spec + wireframe) → verify user stories → check off `tasks.md`.

## Commits

Conventional Commits: `feat(core-hr): add worker CRUD with audit log`

## Key paths

- `backend/src/modules/` — HR bounded contexts (to be created)
- `frontend/src/app/[locale]/(auth)/` — authenticated app
- `docs/design-specs/ui-specifications/` — per-role screens
